{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111140","id":2880021208,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6rqaLY","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111140","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111140.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111140.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111140","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111140/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111140/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111140/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/6cf4daafbb891fe5ced393d829df3247831a7bbd","number":111140,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Use Inter as the default editor font, features enabled","user":{"login":"DeeJayLSP","id":60024671,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDI0Njcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60024671?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP","html_url":"https://github.com/DeeJayLSP","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Related to #111118 (part of it is most of this PR)\r\nCloses https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/discussions/9012.\r\n\r\n## Disclaimer\r\n\r\nSome time ago I did a work to replace the default font with Inter. It is the font I have used in Godot since way before godot-minimal-theme was created.\r\n\r\nI didn't make a pull request out of it as I thought a default theming change like this wouldn't be accepted before 5.0 or something, until #111118 appeared and included the same font change, which made me consider that the change is on the table now.\r\n\r\nAs I believe some things are better done separately, and also wanted to bring attention to certain OpenType features that improve readability, I opted to open this PR.\r\n\r\n## Description\r\n\r\nNoto Sans' main point is that it covers a significant amount of glyphs and avoids displaying invalid characters, but that's only true if you're using all of its fallbacks.\r\n\r\nInter, on the other hand, is a typeface designed for most types of user interface, with many claims that its readability is much better than that of Noto Sans. FOSS projects like GNOME and Blender have adopted it.\r\n\r\nThis PR replaces the default Noto Sans font (but not its fallbacks) with the Inter font.\r\n\r\nAdditionally, I touched some OpenType features:\r\n`calt`: Contextual alternates. Comes enabled by default in Inter, so it was disabled.\r\n`ss04`: Enables serifed `I` and tailed `l`, which makes them better distinct as the default is literally indistinguishable.\r\n`tnum`: Tabular figures. Enabling them makes numeric fields in the Inspector look better.\r\n\r\nThese are only applied if Main Font is unset and shouldn't carry over to custom fonts. They may be enabled/disabled through Main Font Custom OpenType Features by setting them to false (it's documented).\r\n\r\nUsing font feature freeze would imply modification by the terms of OFL, so to avoid having to manipulate copyright stuff, features gets set through code.\r\n\r\nI got some pangrams and other examples in the editor for reference:\r\n\r\n### Before (Noto Sans):\r\n<img width=\"876\" height=\"201\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/588db8c3-6ff1-48f7-9de4-a36872209c66\" />\r\n<img width=\"125\" height=\"76\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b2fbbb45-7b97-461e-ab1d-6a26612cb5ba\" />\r\n<img width=\"141\" height=\"52\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/defd466b-d631-48ca-abe0-be5e136feef6\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n### After (Inter with disambiguation):\r\n<img width=\"937\" height=\"198\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a5b727cf-29b2-4f00-9c39-fa0aacc60809\" />\r\n<img width=\"135\" height=\"73\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/34edb85b-d265-4782-af4c-633d9953572f\" />\r\n<img width=\"153\" height=\"60\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/26af2259-734c-44b4-abf7-97352d9d190d\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n## Considerations\r\nDroid Sans, Roboto, Noto Sans and Inter all seem to be built on the same foundation, so metrics should be pretty much compatible.\r\n\r\nIn fact, Inter began as a superset of Roboto, which itself uses Noto Sans as a fallback on Android.\r\n\r\nThere are concerns about some concerns about some glyphs from Noto Sans missing in Inter, but those are usually not available in a keyboard.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518733,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg3MzM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/usability","name":"usability","description":"","color":"447744","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","number":23,"state":"closed","title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2978,"created_at":"2025-05-22T16:25:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T16:23:23Z","closed_at":"2026-01-26T18:09:14Z","due_on":null},"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-10-01T23:45:47Z","updated_at":"2025-10-22T00:44:15Z","closed_at":"2025-10-22T00:16:39Z","merged_at":"2025-10-22T00:16:39Z","merge_commit_sha":"361ea1153ee0e226947d5f5f8ba862a2bbe3316e","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"DeeJayLSP:gdinter","ref":"gdinter","repo":{"id":413599805,"node_id":"R_kgDOGKcIPQ","name":"godot","full_name":"DeeJayLSP/godot","owner":{"login":"DeeJayLSP","id":60024671,"node_id":"